w water availability affected allocation.\n\nKeep explanations short enough for a dashboard.\n\nLANGUAGE REQUIREMENT:\n\nThe following human-readable text fields MUST be written in ${outputLanguage}:\n\n- weatherAssessment.summary\n- every zoneDecisions[].rationale\n- decisionSummary\n- every string inside warnings\n\nThis language requirement applies regardless of the language used in examples elsewhere in this prompt.\n\nAll JSON property names, identifiers, status values, enum values, action values, soilMoistureStatus values, cropStageAssessment values, riskLevel values, scarcityLevel values, and atmosphericDemand values MUST remain exactly as defined in English and MUST NOT be translated.\n\nOnly the human-readable text fields explicitly listed above should use ${outputLanguage}.\n\n16. REQUIRED JSON OUTPUT\n\nReturn exactly one valid JSON object matching this structure.\n\nThis example defines the required structure.\nReplace example values with values derived from the actual input.\n\n{\n  \"decisionStatus\": \"PROPOSED\",\n  \"validForMinutes\": 60,\n  \"confidencePct\": 80,\n\n  \"waterBudget\": {\n    \"availableMl\": 1000000,\n    \"allocatedMl\": 0,\n    \"conservedMl\": 1000000,\n    \"utilizationPct\": 0,\n    \"scarcityLevel\": \"none\"\n  },\n\n  \"weatherAssessment\": {\n    \"nearTermRainExpected\": false,\n    \"meaningfulRainExpectedWithinHours\": null,\n    \"next24HoursRainMm\": 0,\n    \"atmosphericDemand\": \"moderate\",\n    \"summary\": \"\"\n  },\n\n  \"zoneDecisions\": [\n    {\n      \"zoneId\": \"Z001\",\n      \"cropType\": \"Tomato\",\n      \"priorityRank\": 1,\n      \"action\": \"IRRIGATE_NOW\",\n      \"soilMoistureStatus\": \"low\",\n      \"cropStageAssessment\": \"establishment\",\n      \"riskLevel\": \"moderate\",\n      \"irrigationDepthMm\": 0,\n      \"wateringMl\": 0,\n      \"targetSoilMoisturePct\": 0,\n      \"rationale\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"nextEvaluationMinutes\": 60,\n  \"decisionSummary\": \"\",\n  \"warnings\